note S4 empty text: a callee that walks its view (for i ulong len s, get s i) reads no byte of `text e ""`.
note x = 100000000 is live in the register the old lowering read as the count, so the old loop ran off the
note image (SIGSEGV). Exit 0 when the sum is 0, else 1.
om2
text e ""
fn sum s view uchar * to ulong
t = ulong 0
for i ulong len s
t = add t ulong get s i
end
ret t
end
fn main to int
x = ulong 100000000
if ne sum e 0
ret 1
end
ret int sub x 100000000
end
